<p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gold sm:mb-4\">Reiseprogramm</p><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">MEDYA TRAVEL Reiseprogramm</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:mt-6 sm:text-base\">Entdecken Sie unsere exklusiv zusammengestellten Reisen.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:mt-10 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4\"><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-syria-journey-de.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full bg-gold px-8 py-3.5 text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-luxury text-brand transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-bronze sm:w-auto sm:px-10 sm:py-4\">Reisebroschüre herunterladen</a><a class=\"w-full border border-white/20 px-8 py-3.5 text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-luxury text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:border-gold hover:text-gold sm:w-auto sm:px-10 sm:py-4\" href=\"/de/reisen/erste-syrienreise/\">Reiseprogramm ansehen</a></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-charcoal\" href=\"/de/reisen/erste-syrienreise/\"><div class=\"relative min-h-72 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Erste Syrienreise\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/syria/palmyra-columns.webp\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand via-brand/15 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-5 top-5 h-16 w-32\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain drop-shadow-[0_3px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.75)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nlA5g82W2baOf4FvFmvwOxuR6PI9ZRi1/view?usp=sharing\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">Aktuelle Reise</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-white\">Erste Syrienreise</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/70\">7 Tage / 6 Nächte</p></div></div></a><a class=\"group overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-charcoal\" href=\"/de/reisen/essentielles-spanien/\"><div class=\"relative min-h-72 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Essentielles Spanien\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://iberica-travel.com/files/travel%20packages%202018/3.%20Andalusia%20and%20Levante/CityofArtsandSciencesValenciaTitle.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand via-brand/15 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-5 top-5 h-16 w-32\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain drop-shadow-[0_3px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.75)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nlA5g82W2baOf4FvFmvwOxuR6PI9ZRi1/view?usp=sharing\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">Aktuelle Reise</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-white\">Essentielles Spanien</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/70\">6 Tage / 5 Nächte</p></div></div></a></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/10 pt-10 sm:mt-16 sm:pt-12\"><h3 class=\"text-center font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl\">Spanien-Broschüren</h3><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-essential-spain-de.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-101</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">Spanien kompakt</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">Broschüre öffnen</p></a><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-andalusian-highlights-de.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-102</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">Höhepunkte Andalusiens</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">Broschüre öffnen</p></a><a href=\"/brochures/medya-travel-southern-spain-coast-de.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-6 transition hover:border-gold/60\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">M-103</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-white\">Südspanien und Küste</h4><p class=\"mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/60 transition group-hover:text-gold\">Broschüre öffnen</p></a></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-12 flex max-w-lg flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/70 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm sm:mt-16 sm:flex-row sm:gap-8 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"relative h-16 w-40 shrink-0 sm:h-20 sm:w-48\"><img alt=\"Logo unseres syrischen Reisepartners\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783899048/Screenshot_2026-07-12_190135_tlslpg.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:text-start\">Gemeinsam mit erfahrenen Partnern vor Ort stellen wir sicher, dass jedes Detail Ihrer Syrien-Reise höchsten Ansprüchen an Komfort, Qualität und Authentizität entspricht.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"bg-charcoal py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-gold/30 sm:max-w-md\"><img alt=\"Profilbild der Gründerin oder des Gründers von MEDYA TRAVEL\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783898973/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_10_2026_02_57_14_PM_cavnct.png\"/></div><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gold sm:mb-4\">Über uns</p><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Ein neuer Maßstab für Reisen nach Syrien</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:mt-6 sm:text-base\">MEDYA TRAVEL entstand aus einer klaren Überzeugung: Syrien soll nicht nur besucht, sondern in seiner ganzen Tiefe erlebt werden. Wir gestalten private Reisen für Menschen, die Diskretion, kulturelle Substanz und kompromisslosen Komfort schätzen.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-light-gray sm:text-base\">Jede Reiseroute wird persönlich zusammengestellt – von historischen Spaziergängen durch Damaskus bis zu Abendessen bei Sonnenuntergang an der Mittelmeerküste. Präzise geplant, stilvoll umgesetzt und begleitet von echter syrischer Gastfreundschaft.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-8\"><div class=\"relative flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-gold/30\"><img alt=\"Logo des offiziellen syrischen Partners\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783899048/Screenshot_2026-07-12_190135_tlslpg.png\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-luxury text-light-gray\">Offizieller Partner in Syrien</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"request\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-36 top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-gold/10 blur-[120px]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:px-10\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold\">Reiseanfrage</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl font-serif text-4xl leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl\">Erzählen Sie uns, wie Sie reisen möchten</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-lg text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\">Füllen Sie das kurze Formular aus. Ihre Anfrage wird anschließend in WhatsApp geöffnet und kann direkt an unser Reiseteam gesendet werden.</p></div><form class=\"grid gap-5 border border-white/10 bg-charcoal/80 p-5 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm sm:grid-cols-2 sm:p-8\"><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">Vor- und Nachname<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"name\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">E-Mail-Adresse<!-- --> *<input type=\"email\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"email\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">Telefon / WhatsApp<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"tel\" dir=\"ltr\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">Wohnsitzland<!-- --> *<input class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">Anzahl der Reisenden<!-- --> *<input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70\">Gewünschter Reisezeitraum<input type=\"date\" class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/70 sm:col-span-2\">Wünsche oder Fragen<textarea class=\"mt-2 min-h-12 w-full border border-white/15 bg-brand/60 px-4 text-sm text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-white/25 focus:border-gold min-h-32 py-3\"></textarea></label><div class=\"sm:col-span-2\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"min-h-13 w-full bg-gold px-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand transition hover:bg-bronze sm:w-auto\">Reiseanfrage senden</button><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[11px] leading-5 text-white/40\">Ihre Angaben werden auf dieser Website nicht gespeichert. Sie werden erst beim Absenden an WhatsApp übergeben.</p></div></form></div></section></main><footer id=\"book\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 bg-brand py-14 sm:py-20\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-gold/5 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.7fr_1.1fr]\"><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-4\" aria-label=\"MEDYA TRAVEL – Startseite\" href=\"/de/\"><span class=\"relative h-20 w-20 overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-gold/60 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(199,156,89,0.2)]\"><img alt=\"MEDYA TRAVEL\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/lclxcm8g/image/upload/v1783941973/Gemini_Generated_Image_27jxkk27jxkk27jx_m7v3kj.png\"/></span><span><span class=\"block font-serif text-2xl tracking-[0.12em] text-white\">MEDYA TRAVEL</span><span class=\"block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">Reisen wie es sein sollte</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-light-gray\">Exklusiv geplante Privatreisen durch Syrien, die Reisende aus Deutschland mit Geschichte, Kultur, Gastfreundschaft und außergewöhnlichen Begegnungen verbinden.</p><a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center border border-gold bg-gold px-6 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand transition hover:bg-transparent hover:text-gold\" href=\"/de/#request\">Reise jetzt buchen</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold\">Navigation</h2><nav class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4\" aria-label=\"Navigation im Seitenfuß\"><a class=\"w-fit text-sm text-white/65 transition hover:text-gold\" href=\"/de/reiseziele/\">Reiseziele</a><a class=\"w-fit text-sm text-white/65 transition hover:text-gold\" href=\"/de/reisen/erste-syrienreise/\">Die Reise</a><a class=\"w-fit text-sm text-white/65 transition hover:text-gold\" href=\"/de/#catalogue\">Broschüre</a><a class=\"w-fit text-sm text-white/65 transition hover:text-gold\" href=\"/de/#about\"